{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">馬國明近日攜手蕭正楠與曹永廉前往馬來西亞舉行演唱會，現場氣氛熱烈，觀眾捧場不斷。馬國明14日在社交網站分享演唱會花絮相片，相中見他與兩位拍檔在台上合作無間，盡情享受舞台。</p><div class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted\" data-rich-content=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></div><p id=\"p-rc_8894cd11ae69ea3a-411\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">為了答謝當地觀眾的熱情支持，馬國明在演出期間特別走落台與觀眾近距離接觸，不停揮手互動，現場粉絲紛紛爭相拍照留念。</p><p id=\"p-rc_8894cd11ae69ea3a-411\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b4517fdd-498c-4910-912c-8363b699e6a3.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/20267c3SxCMgFi1784022608.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b4517fdd-498c-4910-912c-8363b699e6a3.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"42fb136d-f8ff-4b39-a66a-dd650069b2f4.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026VoVWcfQUJ21784022613.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"42fb136d-f8ff-4b39-a66a-dd650069b2f4.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted\" data-rich-content=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></div><p id=\"p-rc_8894cd11ae69ea3a-412\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">馬國明對馬來西亞充滿深厚感情，他在文中感性表示：「馬來西亞係我嘅福地……記得 2012 年第 1 次憑《On Call 36小時》攞最佳男主角獎……就係喺大馬……謝謝各位大馬嘅 fans……」。他更感謝當地觀眾的熱情、支持與鼓勵，並甜蜜表白：「再 1 次謝謝大馬嘅觀眾……愛你們……」。帖文一出，隨即引來大批粉絲點讚，並留言承諾會永遠支持他。</p><div class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted\" data-rich-content=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-19T04:18:45.001528+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":314,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}